  "implementation": "Shared adaptive cubic fitting in a unit common chart. A bounded degree-min(3,n-1) B-spline maps output stations to normalized source arc length, reusing the existing portable interpolation solve. Positive derivative controls prove monotonicity. Source-span inversion is bounded, known stations retain their exact source arc distances, fixed handles use chain-rule speeds and position constraints retain exact stored-curve admission. The native path reuses the existing usd-brep fixed-row solve.",
